WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.590
Have you ever wondered what&nbsp;
SCP-914, the Clockworks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:06.770
wants? If it can even want&nbsp;
anything in the first place?

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:11.390
Foundation scientists snapped a&nbsp;
picture of SCP-914 with SCP-978,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:15.830
the Desire Camera, while it was idle&nbsp;
between tests, and this was the result:

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:20.450
"No change. Careful analysis of the&nbsp;
picture shows 914's knob is pointing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:25.070
to a sixth setting after "Very Fine". The&nbsp;
label for that setting is not readable."

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:27.830
It seems as if the machine is fairly content with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:31.250
its lot in life. I wonder what&nbsp;
that sixth setting is, though...

